{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPanelImports",
  "$description": "The Navigator's Packages panel: what the thing in front of you is allowed to use. It has two moods and one shape. Over `project.json` it lists the project's imported modules and offers the two npm verbs a project has — install a package, uninstall one; over a page, layout or component it lists that document's `$ref` imports and the picker that adds one. Both moods then draw the same thing underneath — one section per npm package the registry knows, with a checkbox per element, which is the cherry-pick. The adapter (`surfaces/panel-imports.ts`) hands in rows that are already strings and booleans: nothing here asks what a specifier is, whether an element is already imported, or which of the two moods a document is in. A component row carries an `id` the flow minted, because the two arrays are NESTED and `$map/item` inside the inner one is the element rather than the package it came from — so the row cannot name its own package and does not have to.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "imports"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The panel's own look, keyed on `part`. Thirteen `.import*` rules in `styles/panels.css` become the parts below — `.imports-panel`'s own scroll and padding are the root's declarations here — and exactly one does not come with them: `.import-add-form sp-textfield` reached INSIDE another component to widen it, which is a thing a part cannot do and no longer has to, because `[part=\"field\"]` is the field itself. Five names that never had a rule at all travel with them and stop being names: `imports-component-list`, `import-component-row`, `import-component-label`, `import-add-name` and `import-add-path` were handles rather than styling, and a `part` is the handle now. Two token repairs came too. `--spectrum-font-size-50` resolved only inside `<sp-theme>` and a document is mounted outside it, so every row that read it would silently have taken its 11px fallback; each is `--jx-text-sm` here. And `.imports-count` read `--text-hint`, a name NO stylesheet in this package defines — an unresolvable custom property makes the whole declaration invalid at computed-value time, so the count has been inheriting its colour all along rather than taking the one that was written for it. It says `--fg-dim`, which is what it was drawing anyway.",
    "display": "block",
    "overflowY": "auto",
    "padding": "var(--jx-space-2)",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"section\"]": {
      "marginBottom": "var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"section-header\"]": {
      "$description": "The uppercase band every section opens with. It is the only thing that ever styled a section title, which is why `[part=\"title\"]` below carries one declaration and not six: the weight, the size, the colour and the letter-spacing are all inherited from here.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "6px",
      "padding": "6px 8px 2px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "textTransform": "uppercase",
      "letterSpacing": "0.5px"
    },
    "& [part=\"title\"][data-mono]": {
      "$description": "A package name is an identifier, so it is set in the monospace face and NOT uppercased. The uppercasing is the header's, and it applied to these titles too: `@acme/kit` was drawn as `@ACME/KIT`, which is a name npm does not have. Case is meaning here, so the band's transform stops at this one part.",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)",
      "textTransform": "none"
    },
    "& [part=\"count\"]": {
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"components\"]": {
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "padding": "3px var(--jx-space-2)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]:hover": {
      "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"name\"]": {
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"path\"]": {
      "$description": "The specifier: a module path or a `$ref`. It takes the row's slack and ellipses rather than wrapping, because a row is a line and a wrapped path would push the remove button off the one the eye is on. The `title` attribute beside it is what makes the full text readable when it does.",
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The compact teaching state, drawn here rather than by `panels/empty-state.ts`: that helper is a lit template, and a surface is a document or a lit template and never a mix. It keeps the compact variant's shape — left-aligned, above the add form that IS its action, so it offers no button of its own (empty-state rule 2's stated exception).",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-3) var(--jx-space-4)",
      "maxWidth": "34ch",
      "lineHeight": "1.5",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"add\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"field\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"picker\"]": {
      "width": "100%"
    },
    "& [part=\"component-label\"]": {
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "mood-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/mode"
      },
      "cases": {
        "site": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section",
            "data-section": "modules"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "section-header"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "title"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Imported Modules"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "count"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.moduleCount}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "modules-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/moduleState"
              },
              "cases": {
                "empty": {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Imported modules give this project extra kinds of data — a content collection, a CMS, an API client. Name one below."
                },
                "listed": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "list"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "$prototype": "Array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/modules"
                      },
                      "key": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                      },
                      "map": {
                        "tagName": "div",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "row",
                          "data-import": "${$map.item.name}"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "name",
                              "title": "${$map.item.path}"
                            },
                            "textContent": "${$map.item.name}"
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "path"
                            },
                            "textContent": "${$map.item.path}"
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "remove"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "icon": "x",
                              "size": "sm",
                              "quiet": true,
                              "label": "Remove the ${$map.item.name} import",
                              "hint": "Remove"
                            },
                            "onclick": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/removeModule"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "add",
                "data-add": "import"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "field",
                    "data-field": "name"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "label": "Import name",
                    "placeholder": "Name",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "value": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/addName"
                    }
                  },
                  "oninput": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/editName"
                        },
                        "value": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "field",
                    "data-field": "path"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "label": "Import path",
                    "placeholder": "Path",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "mono": true,
                    "value": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/addPath"
                    }
                  },
                  "oninput": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/editPath"
                        },
                        "value": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "add-button",
                    "data-add": "import"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "icon": "plus",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "quiet": true,
                    "label": "Add import",
                    "hint": "Add import"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/addModule"
                        },
                        "value": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "document": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section",
            "data-section": "refs"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "section-header"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "title"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Components"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "count"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.refCount}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "refs-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/refState"
              },
              "cases": {
                "empty": {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.refEmptyMessage}"
                },
                "listed": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "list"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "$prototype": "Array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/refs"
                      },
                      "key": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/ref"
                      },
                      "map": {
                        "tagName": "div",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "row",
                          "data-ref": "${$map.item.ref}"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "path",
                              "title": "${$map.item.ref}"
                            },
                            "textContent": "${$map.item.ref}"
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "remove"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "icon": "x",
                              "size": "sm",
                              "quiet": true,
                              "label": "Remove the ${$map.item.ref} import",
                              "hint": "Remove"
                            },
                            "onclick": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/removeRef"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/ref"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "picker-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/hasOptions"
              },
              "cases": {
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "add",
                    "data-add": "component"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "jx-select",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "picker"
                      },
                      "$props": {
                        "label": "Add component",
                        "size": "sm",
                        "options": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/pickerOptions"
                        },
                        "value": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/pickerValue"
                        }
                      },
                      "onchange": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/pick"
                            },
                            "value": [
                              {
                                "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$prototype": "Array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/state/packages"
      },
      "key": {
        "$ref": "$map/item/name"
      },
      "map": {
        "tagName": "div",
        "attributes": {
          "part": "section",
          "data-package": "${$map.item.name}"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "section-header"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "span",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "title",
                  "data-mono": "true"
                },
                "textContent": "${$map.item.name}"
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "remove-package-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/canRemove"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "true": {
                    "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "remove-package"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "icon": "x",
                      "size": "sm",
                      "quiet": true,
                      "label": "Remove the ${$map.item.name} package",
                      "hint": "Remove package"
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/removePackage"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "components"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "$prototype": "Array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/components"
                },
                "key": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                },
                "map": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "row",
                    "data-component": "${$map.item.id}"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "jx-checkbox",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "component"
                      },
                      "$props": {
                        "size": "sm",
                        "checked": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/enabled"
                        }
                      },
                      "onchange": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/toggleComponent"
                            },
                            "value": [
                              {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                              },
                              {
                                "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "component-label"
                          },
                          "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "dependency-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/mode"
      },
      "cases": {
        "site": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section",
            "data-section": "add-dependency"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "section-header"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "title"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Add Dependency"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "add",
                "data-add": "package"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "field",
                    "data-field": "package"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "label": "Package name",
                    "placeholder": "Package name…",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "value": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/addPackageValue"
                    }
                  },
                  "oninput": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/editPackage"
                        },
                        "value": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "onkeydown": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "$switch": {
                          "$ref": "event#/key"
                        },
                        "cases": {
                          "Enter": [
                            {
                              "preventDefault": true
                            },
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/addPackage"
                              },
                              "value": []
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "add-button",
                    "data-add": "package"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "icon": "plus",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "quiet": true,
                    "label": "Add package",
                    "hint": "Add package"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/addPackage"
                        },
                        "value": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
